            <ArticleTitle>Technique of using the St. Jude aortic connector with the radial artery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>633-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a technique for the use of St. Jude Aortic Connector System with the radial artery. This technique will allow surgeons, who prefer the radial artery to the vein, to use this approach whenever feasible.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
